{"path":"about.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fbfcfd;--muted:#68717a;--accent:#2d6fa6;--card:#ffffff;--radius:12px}
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial;color:#102025;background:var(--bg)}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px 28px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,.6),transparent)}
    .brand{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#4aa0d5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    .cta{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none}
    .container{max-width:920px;margin:28px auto;padding:24px}
    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;align-items:center}
    .card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(15,20,20,0.06);padding:20px}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:26px}
    p.lead{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .two{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 360px;gap:18px;margin-top:18px}
    aside .card{position:sticky;top:22px}
    label{display:block;margin:10px 0 6px;font-weight:600}
    input[type=text],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e3e7ea}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px;cursor:pointer}
    footer{padding:28px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
    .micro{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .chip{background:#f6fbff;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e8f3fb;color:#094a66}
    /* modal */
    .overlay{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(6,10,12,0.4);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:60}
    .modal{background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:12px;width:720px;max-width:94%;box-shadow:0 20px 40px rgba(8,12,16,0.28)}
    .modal header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
    .breath-circle{width:140px;height:140px;border-radius:999px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e6f4fb,#d6effa);margin:auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:700;color:#094a66}
    .steps{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px}
    .wizard-progress{display:flex;gap:6px}
    .wizard-step{flex:1;height:8px;background:#eef3f5;border-radius:6px}
    .summary{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f8f9fa;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed #e3e7ea;margin-top:8px}
    @media(max-width:840px){.two{grid-template-columns:1fr}.aside{order:-1}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">TP</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Areas I Work With</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="book.html" class="cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="hero card">
      <div>
        <h1>About the clinician</h1>
        <p class="lead">I offer dedicated, confidential support for people navigating life shifts, persistent worry, or transitions. My work is grounded in well-established clinical approaches and shaped around the practical realities you bring.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:8px">
        <button onclick="openExercise()">Try a brief exercise</button>
        <a href="#wizard" style="align-self:center;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600">Start a quick intake</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="two">
      <div>
        <section class="card">
          <h2>Clinical orientation</h2>
          <p style="color:var(--muted)">I combine cognitive, relational, and behavioral strategies to support clearer choices and steadier emotional balance. Treatment is collaborative: we set small, measurable steps and re-evaluate what helps across sessions.</p>

          <h3 style="margin-top:14px">Confidentiality & limits</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Clinical conversations are treated as private. Mandatory reporting and safety concerns (imminent harm to self or others) are exceptions where I must act to ensure safety. This service is not crisis management; if you are in immediate danger call emergency services or a local crisis line.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="card" id="wizard" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h3>Pre-consultation reflection (self-screening)</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted)">A short set of guided prompts to help you notice patterns and prepare questions for a first conversation. This is not a diagnosis—it's a tool for clarity.</p>

          <div id="wizardApp">
            <div class="wizard-card">
              <div class="wizard-progress" id="progress"></div>
              <div id="qArea" style="margin-top:12px"></div>
              <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end">
                <button id="prevBtn" onclick="wizardPrev()" style="display:none;background:#f1f5f7;color:#064a66">Back</button>
                <button id="nextBtn" onclick="wizardNext()">Next</button>
                <button id="doneBtn" onclick="wizardFinish()" style="display:none">Finish &amp; Copy</button>
              </div>
              <div id="summary" class="summary" style="display:none"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="card" style="margin-top:14px">
          <h3>Practical support between sessions</h3>
          <p class="lead">When helpful, I offer short, structured check-ins and simple practice tasks you can use between sessions. These are intended to support skill building, not to replace therapy time.</p>
          <div class="micro" style="margin-top:10px">
            <div class="chip">Weekly reflective prompts</div>
            <div class="chip">Brief skills practice</div>
            <div class="chip">Private scheduling</div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>

      <aside class="aside">
        <div class="card">
          <h3>Membership-style support</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--muted)">Flexible monthly access to scheduled sessions and brief check-ins with steady clinical planning. To learn more, please book a consultation.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:12px"><a class="cta" href="book.html">Request a consult</a></div>

          <h4 style="margin-top:14px">Quick contact</h4>
          <div style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Phone: {{PHONE}}<br/>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a><br/>Location: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:920px;margin:0 auto">
      <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
      <div style="margin-top:6px;color:var(--muted)">Confidential care within agreed clinical limits. If you are in crisis, call local emergency services or a crisis line.</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <div class="overlay" id="overlay">
    <div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
      <header>
        <div style="font-weight:700">Guided practice</div>
        <button onclick="closeExercise()">Close</button>
      </header>
      <div style="margin-top:12px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 240px;gap:12px">
        <div>
          <p style="color:var(--muted)">Choose a short practice to try now. These are simple, grounding skills you can use in daily life.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
            <button onclick="startBreath()">Breathing</button>
            <button onclick="startJournal()">Journaling</button>
            <button onclick="startIntention()">Set an intention</button>
          </div>

          <div id="exerciseArea" style="margin-top:14px"></div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">Quick instructions</div>
          <ul style="color:var(--muted);padding-left:18px">
            <li>Choose one short practice.</li>
            <li>Follow the prompts at your own pace — there's no wrong way.</li>
            <li>Use this as a small reset; it's not a substitute for therapy.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    // --- Self-screening wizard ---
    (function(){
      const questions = [
        {id:'q1',text:'What brings you to consider therapy now? (brief phrase)'} ,
        {id:'q2',text:'How long have these concerns affected you?'} ,
        {id:'q3',text:'What changes would feel most meaningful in the next 3 months?'} ,
        {id:'q4',text:'What strategies have helped you in the past?'} ,
        {id:'q5',text:'What are your most important values or priorities right now?'}
      ];
      let idx=0;const answers={};
      const qArea=document.getElementById('qArea');
      const progress=document.getElementById('progress');
      function renderProgress(){progress.innerHTML='';questions.forEach((q,i)=>{const d=document.createElement('div');d.className='wizard-step';d.style.opacity= i<=idx?1:0.35;progress.appendChild(d)})}
      function render(){renderProgress();qArea.innerHTML='';const q=questions[idx];const label=document.createElement('label');label.textContent=q.text;const ta=document.createElement('textarea');ta.rows=3;ta.value=answers[q.id]||'';ta.oninput=(e)=>answers[q.id]=e.target.value;qArea.appendChild(label);qArea.appendChild(ta);document.getElementById('prevBtn').style.display= idx? 'inline-block':'none';document.getElementById('nextBtn').style.display= idx<questions.length-1? 'inline-block':'none';document.getElementById('doneBtn').style.display= idx===questions.length-1? 'inline-block':'none';}
      window.wizardNext=function(){idx=Math.min(questions.length-1,idx+1);render()}
      window.wizardPrev=function(){idx=Math.max(0,idx-1);render()}
      window.wizardFinish=function(){const summaryEl=document.getElementById('summary');let out='Pre-consultation summary:\n\n';questions.forEach(q=>{out+=q.text+"\n"+ (answers[q.id]||'-') +"\n\n"});out+='Questions I want to bring:\n- ';summaryEl.textContent=out;summaryEl.style.display='block';navigator.clipboard?.writeText(out).catch(()=>{});}
      render();
    })();

    // --- Guided exercise modal ---
    function openExercise(){document.getElementById('overlay').style.display='flex'}
    function closeExercise(){document.getElementById('overlay').style.display='none'; stopBreath();}

    // Breathing animation
    let breathTimer=null;function startBreath(){const area=document.getElementById('exerciseArea');area.innerHTML='';const circle=document.createElement('div');circle.className='breath-circle';circle.textContent='Breathe';area.appendChild(circle);
      let phase=0;const phases=[{label:'Inhale',ms:4000,scale:1.2},{label:'Hold',ms:1500,scale:1.2},{label:'Exhale',ms:5000,scale:0.7},{label:'Rest',ms:1500,scale:0.9}];
      function step(){const p=phases[phase%phases.length];circle.textContent=p.label;circle.style.transition='transform '+(p.ms/1000)+'s ease-in-out';circle.style.transform='scale('+p.scale+')';phase++;breathTimer=setTimeout(step,p.ms)}
      step();
    }
    function stopBreath(){if(breathTimer)clearTimeout(breathTimer);breathTimer=null}

    // Journaling prompt
    function startJournal(){stopBreath();const area=document.getElementById('exerciseArea');area.innerHTML='';const prompt=document.createElement('div');prompt.innerHTML='<div style="font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px">A short journaling prompt</div>';const q=document.createElement('div');q.style.color='#475b63';q.textContent='Write for 6 minutes about a small thing that gave you relief recently. What happened? How did it feel?';prompt.appendChild(q);
      const ta=document.createElement('textarea');ta.rows=6;ta.style.marginTop='8px';prompt.appendChild(ta);
      const start=document.createElement('button');start.textContent='Start 6-minute timer';start.style.marginTop='8px';start.onclick=function(){let t=360;start.disabled=true;const tdiv=document.createElement('div');tdiv.style.marginTop='8px';prompt.appendChild(tdiv);const interval=setInterval(()=>{t--;const m=Math.floor(t/60);const s=t%60;tdiv.textContent='Time left: '+m+':'+(s<10?'0'+s:s);if(t<=0){clearInterval(interval);start.disabled=false;tdiv.textContent='Done — you can review your notes.';}},1000);};
      prompt.appendChild(start);area.appendChild(prompt);
    }

    // Intention setting
    function startIntention(){stopBreath();const area=document.getElementById('exerciseArea');area.innerHTML='';const h=document.createElement('div');h.style.fontWeight='700';h.textContent='Set a short intention';const form=document.createElement('div');form.style.marginTop='8px';const inp=document.createElement('input');inp.type='text';inp.placeholder='A brief intention (e.g., "Listen to my needs")';inp.style.width='100%';const save=document.createElement('button');save.textContent='Save to note';save.style.marginTop='8px';save.onclick=function(){const note='Intention: '+(inp.value||'—');const noteBox=document.createElement('div');noteBox.style.marginTop='8px';noteBox.className='summary';noteBox.textContent=note;form.appendChild(noteBox);};form.appendChild(inp);form.appendChild(save);area.appendChild(h);area.appendChild(form);}
  </script>
</body>
</html>"}
{"path":"specialties.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Areas I Work With — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#fff;--muted:#5e6a6f;--accent:#1873b3;--card:#fff;--radius:14px}
    body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:#0b2228}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:16px 22px;border-bottom:1px solid #eef3f5}
    .logo{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1f6fa0,#3aa0d7);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 8px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:22px auto;padding:18px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:14px}
    .spec{background:#f9fbfc;border-radius:12px;padding:14px;border:1px solid #e8f3f7}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}
    .tag{font-size:13px;color:#0b6fa0;border:1px solid #e2f1fb;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;background:#f0fbff}
    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:16px}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:white;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:0}
    footer{margin-top:22px;padding:18px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}
    @media(max-width:820px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
      <div class="logo">TP</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">Who I Am</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px">
      <div>
        <h1>Focus areas</h1>
        <p class="muted">Common themes I support people with. If you don't see exactly what you need listed, that's okay — bring it to the consult and we'll clarify together.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="tag">Membership-style clinical support</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:16px">
      <div class="grid">
        <div class="spec">
          <h3>Transition & life change</h3>
          <p class="muted">Career shifts, relationship changes, relocation, or new caregiving roles. We work to make meaning of transitions and plan steps that respect your values.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="spec">
          <h3>Anxiety and persistent worry</h3>
          <p class="muted">Practical tools for noticing patterns, responding differently to worry, and widening possibilities for action.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="spec">
          <h3>Low mood and motivation</h3>
          <p class="muted">Small, manageable experiments to build momentum and reconnect with purposeful activity while honoring pace.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="spec">
          <h3>Relationship patterns</h3>
          <p class="muted">Exploring communication, boundaries, and what you want from important connections — whether individual or couples work is recommended.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="spec">
          <h3>Stress from caregiving or work</h3>
          <p class="muted">Techniques for steadying daily functioning, preserving energy, and identifying realistic supports.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="spec">
          <h3>Identity & life stage questions</h3>
          <p class="muted">Spaces to consider identity, values, and next steps without judgment — practical clarity rather than labels.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
      <button onclick="openExercise()">Try a short practice</button>
      <button onclick="document.getElementById('wizardLink').scrollIntoView()">Prepare for consult</button>
    </section>

    <section class="spec" style="margin-top:18px" id="wizardLink">
      <h3>Short self-check to bring to the first meeting</h3>
      <p class="muted">A few focused prompts you can fill out before a consult — it helps clarify priorities and saves time in our first meeting.</p>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:8px">
        <a href="about.html#wizard" style="text-decoration:none"><button>Open the self-check</button></a>
        <a href="book.html" style="text-decoration:none"><button style="background:#ddd;color:#0b2228">Request a consult</button></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:18px">
      <h3>Notes about safety & scope</h3>
      <p class="muted">My work is supportive and aimed at steady change. I do not provide emergency care; if you are in immediate danger, contact emergency services or your local crisis line. Some circumstances may require referral to other providers with different specialties.</p>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div style="max-width:980px;margin:0 auto;padding:12px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)">Contact: {{EMAIL}} • {{PHONE}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
  </footer>

  <div style="display:none" id="overlay"></div>
  <script>
    // Reuse guided exercise from other pages; lightweight duplicate implementation
    function openExercise(){
      const modal = window.open('','exercise','width=520,height=560');
      if(!modal) return alert('Pop-up blocked — try the practice inside the site.');
      modal.document.body.style.fontFamily='system-ui,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial';
      modal.document.title='Short practice';
      modal.document.body.innerHTML=''< + '';
      // Simpler fallback: render a basic breathing instruction
      modal.document.body.innerHTML = '<div style="padding:18px"><h3>Breathing practice</h3><p style="color:#55666a">Simple 4-1-6 cycle: inhale 4s, hold 1s, exhale 6s. Repeat 4 times, at your own pace.</p><button onclick="window.close()">Close</button></div>';
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>"}
{"path":"approach.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>How I Work — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{--bg:#f8fbfc;--muted:#53676b;--accent:#1f79b4}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial;background:var(--bg);color:#062024}
    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:14px 20px}
    .nav a{margin:0 8px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none}
    main{max-width:980px;margin:18px auto;padding:16px}
    .lead-card{background:white;padding:18px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(7,12,14,0.04)}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px}
    .flow{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px}
    .step{background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #e6f2f7}
    .muted{color:var(--muted)}
    .actions{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:14px}
    button{background:var(--accent);border:0;color:white;padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px}
    footer{padding:18px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center">
      <div style="width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1f79b4,#3fb0e0);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700">TP</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav class="nav">
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Investment</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Reach out</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="lead-card">
      <h1>How sessions are structured</h1>
      <p class="muted">My practice focuses on steady progress through collaborative planning, skill practice, and attention to real-world constraints. Each meeting is an opportunity to reflect, try something tangible, and plan the next step.</p>

      <div class="flow">
        <div class="step"><strong>1. Clarify</strong><div class="muted">We name what matters this week and what you'd like to test.</div></div>
        <div class="step"><strong>2. Try</strong><div class="muted">We review practice, try a short in-session strategy, and notice what shifts.</div></div>
        <div class="step"><strong>3. Plan</strong><div class="muted">Collaboratively set small, feasible steps to use between sessions.</div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="actions">
        <button onclick="openExercise()">Try a brief practice</button>
        <a href="book.html" style="text-decoration:none"><button style="background:#2b9c64">Book a consult</button></a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:16px">
      <div class="lead-card">
        <h2>What to expect from membership</h2>
        <p class="muted">Membership is a planning frame: regular sessions plus brief between-session touchpoints. It offers predictability while keeping clinical decisions flexible. Pricing and program details are shared on the Investment page.</p>
        <ul style="color:var(--muted);padding-left:18px">
          <li>Scheduled therapy sessions at a consistent cadence.</li>
          <li>Short, pre-arranged check-ins when needed.</li>
          <li>Clear boundaries about scope and crisis response.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-top:16px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:12px">
      <div class="lead-card">
        <h3>Process and timing</h3>
        <p class="muted">Early sessions focus on understanding patterns and making a realistic plan. We revisit goals every few sessions and adjust priorities. Progress is individualized and paced to what is sustainable for you.</p>

        <h4 style="margin-top:12px">Boundaries & crisis note</h4>
        <p class="muted">While I work to be responsive, this practice is not a crisis service. If you are at immediate risk, please contact emergency services or your local crisis line. Confidentiality is upheld within legal and ethical limits.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="lead-card">
        <h4>Before your first appointment</h4>
        <p class="muted">If helpful, complete the short self-check to bring to the consult. It highlights priorities and helps us use the first session efficiently.</p>
        <div style="margin-top:8px">
          <a href="about.html#wizard" style="text-decoration:none"><button>Open the self-check</button></a>
